R-PB6 R-RG4 R-RG5 R-RG6 R-EC2 R-SH6 (slice 217): the guard runs first for a `github.com` entry (the source is the release URL of the header entry): `read_files repo.json`, `http_get` of the repository, `write_atomic` of the public answer, and only then the read of compat.db, the closure query and the request. Run 2: a private repository gives exit 2 (R-RG6) with no read of compat.db and no request. Run 3: a URL of another host needs no guard call; it gets 200 with written 0 (R-CT4).
